    description: "Find everyday toiletries, choose suitable products for sensitive skin and laundry, then use the photo counter without confusing a drugstore with a pharmacy.",
    focus: "Practical dm/Rossmann-style German: ohne Duftstoffe, für empfindliche Haut, Reisegröße, Nachfüllpackung, Buntwäsche, Flecken and printing photos from a phone.",
